# xUnit Test Project

A unit testing project built using **xUnit.net** and **.NET** to validate the functionality, reliability, and correctness of application components. The project contains automated test cases designed to verify individual methods and application logic in an isolated and repeatable manner.

---

## About the Project

This project demonstrates the implementation of **unit testing using xUnit.net** in a .NET application. Unit tests are written to validate the behavior of individual components and ensure that the application produces the expected results under different scenarios.

The test project can be used alongside **ASP.NET Core MVC**, **ASP.NET Core Web API**, or other .NET applications to improve code quality and reduce the risk of introducing bugs during development.

The tests follow the **Arrange-Act-Assert (AAA)** pattern, making them easy to understand, maintain, and extend.

