## Testing Workflow

The project follows the **Arrange-Act-Assert (AAA)** testing pattern:

```text
┌──────────────────────┐
│       Arrange       │
│ Prepare test data   │
│ and required setup  │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│        Act           │
│ Execute the method   │
│ or functionality     │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│       Assert         │
│ Verify the actual    │
│ result is expected   │
└──────────────────────┘
```

