## Running Tests

Run all unit tests using the .NET CLI:

```bash
dotnet test
```

For detailed test output:

```bash
dotnet test --logger "console;verbosity=detailed"
```

To run tests without rebuilding the project:

```bash
dotnet test --no-build
```

